<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA- to Korea Development Bank samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA- to Korea Development Bank samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had assigned an AA- rating to Korea Development Bank's 30 billion yen worth of 5.1 percent yen/dollar dual currency bonds due August 21, 2000.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
